<!-- InvoiceDetail (design-projects.md §10 InvoiceDetail, the Invoice detail of research-crosscut §3; style-guide §3.3 Detail;
    impl-projects.md P8a): one invoice, mounted by Projects at Projects/Billing/InvoiceDetail. Built for the Projects context now
    (impl-projects.md §4: expanded when design-crosscut and Accounting need more); appRoot will choose the context then, as
    Shared/RequestDetail does, and every other app root reads it as Projects until it has its own.

    Projects (service/ironstone/projects/BillingServices.xml get#InvoiceDetail): for one who manages money and sees one of the invoice's projects;
    anyone else gets "not available". The title row: the invoice, its kind, the client, the status-bar (read only: In-Process,
    Finalized, Sent, Payment Received; the moves are the actions), overdue; the actions on a client invoice: Approve (a draft; primary),
    Send (approves a draft first; email to the client's billing address with the PDF and the time detail; primary once approved), Print
    and PDF (Billing/InvoicePrint.xml), Edit (a draft: date, payment terms, reference, description, message), Resume changes (approved),
    Cancel (a draft or approved: its time is unbilled again). The number cards: Total, Unpaid, Due, Hours. The boxes: Details, Lines
    (each with the time or the milestone behind it; Remove on a draft frees its time or makes its milestone share due again), Milestones
    (the milestone billing shares billed, each with its order line: impl-projects.md P8b), Time (every entry billed: day, who, work item,
    hours, rate, amount, comment), Payments; Chatter as the right column from 1440 px. Worker and expense invoices are read only here.

    A client (impl-projects.md P10b; get#InvoiceDetail clientView) sees its own sent invoices read only: the details, the projects, the
    lines, the milestones billed (without the order link), the payments, Print and the PDF, and the time of the lines only when the
    project shares its hours (day, work item and hours); never Chatter, who worked, a rate, an amount of time, an address to send to
    or a move. Its transitions are refused a client twice: the write services are denied it (BOSS_PROJECTS_INTERNAL) and each
    asks get#InvoiceAccess with need change, which a client never passes.

    Warehouse (crosscut §3.16 Warehouse row; impl-warehouse P13; mounted at Warehouse/Orders/InvoiceDetail): an invoice linked to
    a shipment of the user's facilities (ironstone.warehouse.ShippingServices.get#InvoiceEvidence), read and print only: the
    header and posting state, the lines with their shipments and shipped quantities, and the shipments; totals, payments and
    line amounts only with financial read (ACCOUNTING_VIEW). Its widgets are template/WarehouseInvoiceDetail.xml's; the
    Projects transitions are not reached from it.

    Purchasing (crosscut §3.16 Purchasing row; impl-purchasing P6; mounted at Purchasing/Bills/InvoiceDetail): a supplier bill
    of the user's buying organizations (ironstone.purchasing.BillServices.get#BillDetail): its header, holds, match
    exceptions, lines, the order lines and receipts it bills, payments for a finance reader and documents; a buyer
    investigates and asks for a hold's release, a match operator opens the shared InvoiceMatch, Accounting's landed costs
    for a GL poster. Its widgets and transition are template/PurchasingInvoiceDetail.xml's.

    People (design-people §13 InvoiceDetail; crosscut §3.16 People row; impl-people P15, F19; mounted at People/Payroll/InvoiceDetail):
    an expense claim's invoice for a holder of PEOPLE_EXPENSE_MANAGE at the employer (mantle.humanres.ExpenseServices.get#Claim), read and reconcile
    only: the header, the settlement (route, applied, unpaid, the payments applied), the lines and the claim. Its widgets are
    template/PeopleInvoiceDetail.xml's. P27: a payroll reader's branch, an invoice a pay run's obligation names (net pay, a payee's
    amounts, a receivable, a claim it settled; mantle.humanres.PayrollRunServices.get#Obligation): read and reconcile only.

    Customer Service (crosscut §3.16 Customer Service row; impl-customer-service P3, F53; mounted at
    CustomerService/Orders/InvoiceDetail): a sales invoice of a customer the user serves
    (ironstone.customerservice.OrderServices.get#InvoiceDetail), customer-safe: its header, lines, payment status, orders and
    cases, the amounts only for a finance reader, and Send a copy (Accounting's send#Invoice) for a receivables editor; no
    correction. Its widgets and transition are template/CustomerServiceInvoiceDetail.xml's. -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Invoice" default-menu-include="false">

    <parameter name="invoiceId" required="true"/>

    <transition name="changeStatus">
        <actions>
            <service-call name="ironstone.projects.BillingServices.update#InvoiceStatus" out-map="statusOut" in-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, action:action}"/>
            <if condition="!ec.message.hasError()"><script>ec.message.addMessage(statusOut.message, 'success')</script></if>
        </actions>
        <default-response url="."><parameter name="invoiceId"/></default-response>
        <error-response url="."/>
    </transition>
    <transition name="updateHeader">
        <actions>
            <service-call name="ironstone.projects.BillingServices.update#InvoiceHeader" out-map="headerOut" in-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, invoiceDate:(invoiceDate || null),
                    settlementTermId:(settlementTermId || null), referenceNumber:(referenceNumber ?? null), description:(description ?? null), invoiceMessage:(invoiceMessage ?? null)}"/>
            <if condition="!ec.message.hasError()"><script>ec.message.addMessage(headerOut.message, 'success')</script></if>
        </actions>
        <default-response url="."><parameter name="invoiceId"/></default-response>
        <error-response url="."/>
    </transition>
    <transition name="removeLine">
        <actions>
            <service-call name="ironstone.projects.BillingServices.remove#InvoiceLine" out-map="removeOut" in-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, invoiceItemSeqId:invoiceItemSeqId}"/>
            <if condition="!ec.message.hasError()"><script>ec.message.addMessage(removeOut.message, 'success')</script></if>
        </actions>
        <default-response url="."><parameter name="invoiceId"/></default-response>
        <error-response url="."/>
    </transition>
    <transition name="sendInvoice">
        <actions>
            <service-call name="ironstone.projects.BillingServices.send#Invoice" out-map="sendOut" in-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, toAddresses:(toAddresses || ''), note:(note || null)}"/>
            <if condition="!ec.message.hasError()"><script>ec.message.addMessage(sendOut.message, 'success')</script></if>
        </actions>
        <default-response url="."><parameter name="invoiceId"/></default-response>
        <error-response url="."/>
    </transition>
    <transition name="invoices"><default-response url="//Projects/Billing/Invoices"/></transition>
    <!-- Purchasing (impl-purchasing P6): ask for a hold's release -->
    <transition-include name="billRequestRelease" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingInvoiceDetail.xml"/>
    <!-- Customer Service (impl-customer-service P3): send a copy -->
    <transition-include name="serviceInvoiceCopy" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceInvoiceDetail.xml"/>

    <!-- Insights (appRoot Insights, mounted at Insights/Records/InvoiceDetail; design-insights §10, crosscut's Insights row, impl-insights
        P6): read only, in place of the owners' contexts. The condition fails for Insights, so none of the actions and widgets
        below runs, and the fail-widgets show template/InsightsRecord.xml: the record as the admitted datasets the viewer reads
        show it, the owners' screens of it that open to them, and the return to the report; no action. -->
    <condition><expression>appRoot != 'Insights'</expression></condition>
    <actions><script><![CDATA[
        warehouseRoot = typeof appRoot !== 'undefined' && appRoot === 'Warehouse'
        purchasingRoot = typeof appRoot !== 'undefined' && appRoot === 'Purchasing'
        serviceRoot = typeof appRoot !== 'undefined' && appRoot === 'CustomerService'
        peopleRoot = typeof appRoot !== 'undefined' && appRoot === 'People'
        if (peopleRoot) {
            ec.message.pushErrors()
            try {
                const read = ec.service.sync().name('mantle.humanres.ExpenseServices.get#Claim').parameters({invoiceId: invoiceId || ''})
                    .requireNewTransaction(true).call() || {}
                peopleClaim = !ec.message.hasError() && read.claim && Array.from(read.access || []).includes('manage') ? read : null
            } catch (error) {
                peopleClaim = null
            } finally {
                ec.message.clearErrors()
                ec.message.popErrors()
            }
            // P27: an invoice a pay run's obligation names (net pay, a payee's amounts, a receivable, a claim it settled), for a
            // payroll reader of the employer (mantle.humanres.PayrollRunServices.get#Obligation)
            peopleObligation = null
            if (!peopleClaim) {
                ec.message.pushErrors()
                try {
                    const read = ec.service.sync().name('mantle.humanres.PayrollRunServices.get#Obligation')
                        .parameters({invoiceId: invoiceId || ''}).requireNewTransaction(true).call() || {}
                    peopleObligation = !ec.message.hasError() && read.obligation ? read : null
                } catch (error) {
                    peopleObligation = null
                } finally {
                    ec.message.clearErrors()
                    ec.message.popErrors()
                }
            }
            recordFound = false
            return
        }
        if (serviceRoot) {
            ec.message.pushErrors()
            try {
                const read = ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.customerservice.OrderServices.get#InvoiceDetail')
                    .parameters({appRoot: appRoot, invoiceId: invoiceId || ''}).requireNewTransaction(true).call() || {}
                serviceInvoice = ec.message.hasError() ? null : read.detail || null
            } catch (error) {
                serviceInvoice = null
            } finally {
                ec.message.clearErrors()
                ec.message.popErrors()
            }
            recordFound = false
            return
        }
        if (purchasingRoot) {
            ec.message.pushErrors()
            try {
                const read = ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.purchasing.BillServices.get#BillDetail')
                    .parameters({appRoot: appRoot, invoiceId: invoiceId || ''}).requireNewTransaction(true).call() || {}
                purchasingBill = ec.message.hasError() ? null : read.bill || null
            } finally {
                ec.message.clearErrors()
                ec.message.popErrors()
            }
            recordFound = false
            return
        }
        if (warehouseRoot) {
            const evidence = ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.warehouse.ShippingServices.get#InvoiceEvidence')
                .parameters({invoiceId: invoiceId || ''}).call() || {}
            ec.message.clearErrors()
            warehouseInvoice = evidence.found ? evidence : null
            recordFound = false
            return
        }
        const out = ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.projects.BillingServices.get#InvoiceDetail').parameters({invoiceId: invoiceId || ''}).call() || {}
        ec.message.clearErrors()
        recordFound = !!out.detail
        if (!recordFound) return
        const L = (text) => ec.l10n.localize(text)
        inv = out.detail
        itemRows = inv.itemRows
        entryRows = inv.entryRows
        paymentRows = inv.payments
        projectRows = inv.projects
        milestoneRows = inv.milestoneRows || []
        clientView = !!inv.clientView
        termOptions = clientView ? [] : Array.from(ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.projects.BillingServices.get#BillingSettings').call()?.termOptions || [])
        headerValue = {invoiceId: invoiceId, invoiceDate: inv.invoiceDateValue, settlementTermId: inv.settlementTermId, referenceNumber: inv.referenceNumber,
            description: inv.description, invoiceMessage: inv.invoiceMessage}
        sendValue = {invoiceId: invoiceId, toAddresses: inv.sendTo, note: ''}
        stateText = inv.overdue ? L('Overdue') + ' · ' + L('due') + ' ' + inv.dueDateText : inv.statusId === 'InvoiceInProcess' ? L('Draft: approve it, then send it to the client')
                : inv.statusId === 'InvoiceFinalized' ? L('Approved, not sent yet') : inv.statusId === 'InvoiceCancelled' ? L('Cancelled: its time is unbilled again') : ''
        stateStyle = inv.overdue ? 'text-negative' : 'm-muted'
        detailRows = [['From', inv.fromName], ['To', inv.toName], ['Invoice date', inv.invoiceDateText], ['Due', inv.dueDateText], ['Payment terms', inv.termText],
            ['Reference', inv.referenceNumber], ['Description', inv.description], ['Message to the client', inv.invoiceMessage]]
                .filter((pair) => pair[1]).map((pair) => ({label: L(pair[0]), value: pair[1]}))
    ]]></script></actions>

    <widgets>
        <section-include name="WarehouseInvoice" location="component://mr-boss/template/WarehouseInvoiceDetail.xml"/>
        <section-include name="PurchasingInvoice" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingInvoiceDetail.xml"/>
        <section-include name="CustomerServiceInvoice" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceInvoiceDetail.xml"/>
        <section-include name="PeopleInvoice" location="component://mr-boss/template/PeopleInvoiceDetail.xml"/>
        <section name="InvoiceNotFound" condition="!recordFound &amp;&amp; !warehouseRoot &amp;&amp; !purchasingRoot &amp;&amp; !serviceRoot &amp;&amp; !peopleRoot"><widgets>
            <container-box type="warning"><box-header title="Not available"/><box-body>
                <label type="p" text="Invoice ${invoiceId} is not available: it does not exist, it is not of a project you see, or you do not manage money."/>
                <link url="invoices" link-type="anchor" text="Back to the invoices"/>
            </box-body></container-box>
        </widgets></section>

        <section name="InvoiceFound" condition="recordFound"><widgets>
            <context record-entity="mantle.account.invoice.Invoice" record-id="${invoiceId}" title="${inv.kindText} ${invoiceId} · ${inv.toName}"/>
            <!-- the header card (style-guide §3.3): the invoice, its client and its state with the status-bar at their right, then the actions -->
            <container style="m-record-header">
                <container style="row items-start q-col-gutter-x-md q-col-gutter-y-sm">
                    <container style="col-12 col-md m-record-title">
                        <container style="row items-center q-gutter-x-sm">
                            <label text="${inv.kindText} ${invoiceId}" type="h5"/>
                            <label text="${inv.toName}" type="span" style="text-subtitle1 m-muted"/>
                        </container>
                        <label text="${stateText}" type="div" style="text-caption ${stateStyle}" condition="stateText"/>
                    </container>
                    <container style="col-12 col-md-auto m-record-status">
                        <status-bar id="InvoiceStatusBar" status-id="${inv.statusId}" status-flow-id="InvoiceReceivable" stages="${inv.stageStatusIds}" read-only="true"/>
                    </container>
                </container>
                <container style="row items-center q-col-gutter-x-md q-col-gutter-y-sm m-record-foot">
                    <container style="col-12 row items-center q-gutter-x-xs q-gutter-y-xs m-record-actions">
                        <link url="changeStatus" link-type="hidden-form" btn-type="primary" text="Approve" icon="sym_o_task_alt" parameter-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, action:'approve'}"
                                condition="inv.canApprove" confirmation="Approve invoice ${invoiceId} for ${inv.totalText}? It is posted and no longer changed."/>
                        <container-dialog id="InvoiceSendDialog" button-text="${inv.sendAgain ? 'Send again' : 'Send'}" icon="sym_o_send" width="560" title="Send invoice ${invoiceId}" condition="inv.canSend">
                            <form-single name="SendInvoice" transition="sendInvoice" map="sendValue" focus-field="toAddresses">
                                <field name="invoiceId"><default-field><hidden/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="toAddresses"><default-field title="To (commas between addresses)"><text-line size="50"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="note"><default-field title="Message"><text-area rows="4" cols="50"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="sendHelp"><default-field title=""><label text="${inv.isDraft ? 'The draft is approved first. ' : ''}The invoice goes as a PDF with its time detail, and its lines are in the message." type="p" style="text-caption m-muted"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="submitButton"><default-field title="Send"><submit/></default-field></field>
                            </form-single>
                        </container-dialog>
                        <link url="${inv.printUrl}" url-type="plain" text="Print" icon="sym_o_print" link-type="anchor-button" target-window="_blank"/>
                        <button-menu text="More" icon="more_horiz" style="q-ml-xs">
                            <link url="${inv.pdfUrl}" url-type="plain" text="Download PDF" icon="sym_o_picture_as_pdf" target-window="_blank"/>
                            <container-dialog id="InvoiceEditDialog" button-text="Edit" icon="sym_o_edit" width="560" title="Edit invoice ${invoiceId}" condition="inv.canEdit">
                                <form-single name="EditInvoiceHeader" transition="updateHeader" map="headerValue">
                                    <field name="invoiceId"><default-field><hidden/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="invoiceDate"><default-field title="Invoice date"><date-time type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd"/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="settlementTermId"><default-field title="Payment terms">
                                        <drop-down allow-empty="true"><list-options list="termOptions" key="${key}" text="${text}"/></drop-down></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="referenceNumber"><default-field title="Reference (the client's PO)"><text-line size="30"/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="description"><default-field title="Description"><text-line size="50"/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="invoiceMessage"><default-field title="Message to the client"><text-area rows="3" cols="50"/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="submitButton"><default-field title="Save"><submit/></default-field></field>
                                    <field-layout>
                                        <field-ref name="invoiceId"/>
                                        <field-row><field-ref name="invoiceDate"/><field-ref name="settlementTermId"/></field-row>
                                        <field-ref name="referenceNumber"/><field-ref name="description"/><field-ref name="invoiceMessage"/>
                                        <field-ref name="submitButton"/>
                                    </field-layout>
                                </form-single>
                            </container-dialog>
                            <link url="changeStatus" link-type="hidden-form-link" text="Resume changes" icon="sym_o_lock_open" parameter-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, action:'resume'}"
                                    condition="inv.canResume" confirmation="Open invoice ${invoiceId} to changes again? Its posting is reversed."/>
                            <link url="changeStatus" link-type="hidden-form-link" text="Cancel the invoice" icon="sym_o_cancel" parameter-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, action:'cancel'}"
                                    condition="inv.canCancel" confirmation="Cancel invoice ${invoiceId}? Its time is unbilled again."/>
                        </button-menu>
                    </container>
                </container>
            </container>

            <dashboard min-width="150" style="q-mb-sm">
                <number-card title="Total" value="${inv.totalText}" icon="sym_o_receipt_long" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Unpaid" value="${inv.unpaidText}" icon="sym_o_account_balance_wallet" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Due" value="${inv.dueDateText || '—'}" icon="sym_o_event" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Hours billed" value="${inv.hoursText}" icon="sym_o_schedule" size="sm" condition="!clientView || entryRows.length"/>
            </dashboard>

            <container style="row q-col-gutter-sm">
                <container style="col-12 col-lg-8">
                    <container-row>
                        <row-col md="6">
                            <container-box><box-header title="Details"/><box-body-nopad>
                                <form-list name="InvoiceDetails" list="detailRows" skip-form="true" skip-header="true" paginate="false">
                                    <field name="label"><default-field><label text="${label}" type="span" style="m-muted text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="value"><default-field><display/></default-field></field>
                                </form-list>
                            </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                        </row-col>
                        <row-col md="6">
                            <container-box><box-header title="Projects"/><box-body-nopad>
                                <form-list name="InvoiceProjects" list="projectRows" skip-form="true" skip-header="true" paginate="false">
                                    <field name="name"><default-field><link url="${url}" url-type="plain" text="${name}" link-type="anchor"/></default-field></field>
                                </form-list>
                            </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                            <container-box><box-header title="Payments"/><box-body-nopad>
                                <form-list name="InvoicePayments" list="paymentRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                                    <field name="paymentId"><default-field title="Payment"><display/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="dateText"><default-field title="Applied"><display/></default-field></field>
                                    <field name="amountText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><display/></default-field></field>
                                </form-list>
                                <label type="p" text="No payments yet." style="m-muted q-pa-sm q-mb-none" condition="!paymentRows.length"/>
                            </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                        </row-col>
                    </container-row>

                    <container-box><box-header title="Lines · ${itemRows.length}"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="InvoiceLines" list="itemRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                            <field name="invoiceItemSeqId"><default-field title="#"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="description"><default-field title="Description">
                                <label text="${description || typeText}" type="span"/>
                                <label text="${timeText}" type="div" style="text-caption m-muted" condition="timeText"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="itemDateText"><default-field title="Date"><label text="${itemDateText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="quantityText" align="right"><default-field title="Quantity"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="amountText" align="right"><default-field title="Price"><label text="${amountText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="totalText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><label text="${totalText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap text-weight-medium"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="remove" align="right"><default-field title="">
                                <link url="removeLine" link-type="hidden-form-link" text="" icon="sym_o_remove_circle" tooltip="Remove the line; its time or milestone share is unbilled again" style="m-btn-flat"
                                        parameter-map="{invoiceId:invoiceId, invoiceItemSeqId:invoiceItemSeqId}" condition="canRemove"
                                        confirmation="Remove line ${invoiceItemSeqId}? ${isMilestone ? 'Its milestone share is due again.' : 'Its time is unbilled again.'}"/></default-field></field>
                            <columns type="mobile">
                                <column><field-ref name="description"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="totalText"/><field-ref name="remove"/></column>
                            </columns>
                        </form-list>
                        <label type="p" text="No lines." style="m-muted q-pa-sm q-mb-none" condition="!itemRows.length"/>
                        <container style="row justify-end q-pa-sm">
                            <label text="Total ${inv.totalText}" type="span" style="text-subtitle1 text-weight-medium"/>
                        </container>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>

                    <section name="InvoiceMilestones" condition="milestoneRows.length"><widgets>
                        <container-box><box-header title="Milestones · ${milestoneRows.length}"/><box-body-nopad>
                            <form-list name="InvoiceMilestoneLines" list="milestoneRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                                <field name="invoiceItemSeqId"><default-field title="Line"><display/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="milestoneName"><default-field title="Milestone">
                                    <link url="${milestoneUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${milestoneName}" link-type="anchor"/>
                                    <label text="${reachedText ? 'Reached ' + reachedText : ''}" type="div" style="text-caption m-muted" condition="reachedText"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="lineText"><default-field title="Order line">
                                    <link url="${orderUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${lineText}" link-type="anchor" condition="orderUrl"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="percentText" align="right"><default-field title="Share"><display/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="amountText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><label text="${amountText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                                <columns type="mobile">
                                    <column><field-ref name="milestoneName"/><field-ref name="lineText"/></column>
                                    <column><field-ref name="amountText"/></column>
                                </columns>
                            </form-list>
                        </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                    </widgets></section>
                    <!-- a client's time: the lines' hours when the project shares them, no one's name, rate or amount -->
                    <section name="ClientTimeBox" condition="clientView &amp;&amp; entryRows.length"><widgets>
                    <container-box><box-header title="Time · ${inv.hoursText} h"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="InvoiceClientTime" list="entryRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false" show-csv-button="true">
                            <field name="invoiceItemSeqId"><default-field title="Line"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="dayText"><default-field title="Day"><label text="${dayText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="itemText"><default-field title="Work item">
                                <link url="${itemUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${itemText}" link-type="anchor" condition="itemUrl"/>
                                <label text="${itemText}" type="span" condition="!itemUrl"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="hoursText" align="right"><default-field title="Hours"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <columns type="mobile">
                                <column><field-ref name="dayText"/><field-ref name="itemText"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="hoursText"/></column>
                            </columns>
                        </form-list>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                    </widgets></section>
                    <section name="InvoiceTimeBox" condition="!clientView &amp;&amp; (entryRows.length || !milestoneRows.length)"><widgets>
                    <container-box><box-header title="Time · ${entryRows.length} entries, ${inv.hoursText} h"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="InvoiceTime" list="entryRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false" show-csv-button="true">
                            <field name="invoiceItemSeqId"><default-field title="Line"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="dayText"><default-field title="Day"><label text="${dayText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="personName"><default-field title="Who"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="itemText"><default-field title="Work item">
                                <link url="${itemUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${itemText}" link-type="anchor" condition="itemUrl"/>
                                <label text="${itemText}" type="span" condition="!itemUrl"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="hoursText" align="right"><default-field title="Hours"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="rateText" align="right"><default-field title="Rate"><label text="${rateText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="amountText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><label text="${amountText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="comments"><default-field title="Comment"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <columns>
                                <column><field-ref name="invoiceItemSeqId"/><field-ref name="dayText"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="personName"/><field-ref name="itemText"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="hoursText"/><field-ref name="rateText"/><field-ref name="amountText"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="comments"/></column>
                            </columns>
                            <columns type="mobile">
                                <column><field-ref name="dayText"/><field-ref name="itemText"/></column>
                                <column><field-ref name="hoursText"/><field-ref name="amountText"/></column>
                            </columns>
                        </form-list>
                        <label type="p" text="No time is billed on this invoice." style="m-muted q-pa-sm q-mb-none" condition="!entryRows.length"/>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                    </widgets></section>
                </container>
                <!-- Chatter, the notes on the invoice, beside the boxes from 1440 px -->
                <section name="InvoiceChatterColumn" condition="!clientView"><widgets>
                <container style="col-12 col-lg-4">
                    <chatter id="InvoiceChatter" record-entity="mantle.account.invoice.Invoice" record-id="${invoiceId}" default-tab="log"/>
                </container>
                </widgets></section>
            </container>
        </widgets></section>
    </widgets>
    <fail-widgets>
        <section name="InsightsContext">
            <actions>
                <set field="insightsRecordType" value="InvoiceDetail"/>
                <set field="insightsRecordId" from="invoiceId"/>
            </actions>
            <widgets><section-include name="InsightsRecord" location="component://mr-boss/template/InsightsRecord.xml"/></widgets>
        </section>
    </fail-widgets>
</screen>
